  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Aquatic_Creepers/MP_AquaticCreepers_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"451\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组引入了全新的水下威胁：<strong>水生苦力怕</strong>！这些生物现在可以生成在<strong>海洋和河流</strong>中，为你的水下冒险增添额外危险。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>准备好和朋友们在最好的主机上一起玩了吗？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Aquatic_Creepers/MP_AquaticCreepers_promo.webp\" width=\"1493\" height=\"187\"></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我推荐使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFlashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a>与朋友一起游玩，他们的服务器质量高且无延迟。你可以安装任何CurseForge整合包或自定义模组，不会出错。此外，他们的客服全天候在线，随时帮你解决问题。使用我的代码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFlashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>可享受25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Aquatic_Creepers/MP_AquaticCreepers_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>⚔️ 主要特点：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">水生苦力怕的<strong>生命值只有普通苦力怕的一半</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它们能检测到<strong>15格</strong>范围内的玩家，并会朝你游过来。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果它们靠近你并在你身边停留几秒……💥 它们就会爆炸！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它们的生成频率<strong>默认较低</strong>，但附带了<strong>配置文件</strong>，玩家可以根据喜好调整生成率。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>✨ 全新专属物品：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>蓝色火药</strong>：由水生苦力怕掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可用于合成<strong>蓝色炸药</strong>，拓展你的战斗与合成玩法。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">有了<strong>水生苦力怕</strong>，海洋将再也不是安全之地……你敢潜入那片窥伺着未知的危险水域吗？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Aquatic_Creepers/MP_AquaticCreepers_screenshot.webp\" width=\"1493\" height=\"123\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1296/282/aquatic-creepers-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1493\" height=\"799\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1296/285/aquatic-creepers-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1493\" height=\"799\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1296/287/aquatic-creepers-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1493\" height=\"799\"></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X4BEeSByGU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Aquatic_Creepers/MP_AquaticCreepers_discord.webp\" width=\"1493\" height=\"123\"></a></strong></p>",
